msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「（For now, I'll drink some coffee to calm＿myself down......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Por ahora tomaré un poco de＿café para calmarme......）」"

msgid "Ami「Hey you. Get rejected?」"
msgstr "Ami「Oye, tú. ¿Te rechazaron?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Kawashima, you squeezed yourself＿in there again?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Kawashima, ¿otra vez＿te apretujaste ahí?」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, you changed the subject.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah, cambiaste de tema.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「From what......? Oh, by the way, don't＿use Haruta and Noto to spread your＿weird rumors.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿De qué......? Ah, por cierto,＿no uses a Haruta y a Noto para＿esparcir tus rumores raros.」"

msgid "Ami「Rumors～? Like, I wonder what you＿mean. Ami-chan doesn't get it.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Rumores～? O sea, me pregunto a qué te＿refieres. Ami-chan no entiende nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't play dumb with me. Rumors like I＿brought you to the planetarium and......＿and came onto you or something!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No te hagas la tonta. ¡Rumores de que＿te llevé al planetario y...... y me＿insinué contigo o algo así!」"

msgid "Ami「......Or are you perhaps concerned that＿someone might get the wrong idea if＿they heard a weird rumor like that?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿O acaso te preocupa que alguien＿se haga una idea equivocada si escucha＿un rumor raro como ese?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Not really. Taiga was there at the time,＿so there's nothing for her to＿misunderstand.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「La verdad no. Taiga estuvo ahí en＿ese momento, así que no hay nada＿que pueda malinterpretar.」"

msgid "Ami「I didn't say anything about Tiger.」"
msgstr "Ami「Yo no dije nada sobre Tigre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Ami「Aha! The little shit rejected you, so＿she's all you can think of, huh?」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Ajá! La maldita mocosa te rechazó,＿así que solo piensas en ella, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Ami「Suits me just fine. Could you stop＿lashing out about Tiger rejecting you?」"
msgstr "Ami「Por mí está bien. ¿Podrías dejar de＿desquitarte porque Tigre te rechazó?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Who's lashing out? I'm just stating＿facts.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Quién se desquita? Solo digo＿las cosas como son.」"

msgid "Ami「I'm stating the facts here, too.」"
msgstr "Ami「Yo también digo las cosas como son.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「She didn't reject me, okay? I just＿wanted to give her this lunchbox.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No me rechazó, ¿entendido? Solo quería＿darle esta caja de almuerzo.」"

msgid "Ami「You \"just wanted to give her this＿lunchbox\"? Don't give me that crap.＿You're just trying to be cool.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Que \"solo querías darle esta caja＿de almuerzo\"? No me vengas con eso.＿Solo intentas parecer genial.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You're really trying to start an＿argument.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......De verdad buscas empezar＿una discusión.」"

msgid "Ami「You couldn't give that lunchbox to＿Tiger, right? In that case, give it to＿Ami-chan.」"
msgstr "Ami「No pudiste darle esa caja de＿almuerzo a Tigre, ¿no? En ese＿caso, dásela a Ami-chan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso es......」"

msgid "Ami「......Just kidding, stupid.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Es broma, tonto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You really are hungry, aren't you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......De verdad tienes hambre, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ami「I, I'm on a diet right now! Leave me＿alone!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡E-Estoy a dieta ahora mismo!＿¡Déjame en paz!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then I'll buy you some juice. That＿should be fine, right? I want to talk to＿you about something.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces te compro un jugo. Eso＿sí se puede, ¿verdad? Quiero＿hablar contigo de algo.」"

msgid "Ami「I have nothing to say. Your stupidity is＿contagious.」"
msgstr "Ami「No tengo nada que decir. Tu＿estupidez se contagia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Would you prefer tea?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Prefieres té?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Here.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Toma.」"

msgid "Ami「Ugh, you're gonna sit there!?」"
msgstr "Ami「Ugh, ¡¿te vas a sentar ahí?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y qué?」"

msgid "Ami「Cramped. Stinks. Stifling.」"
msgstr "Ami「Estrecho. Apesta. Asfixiante.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't stink.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Yo no apesto.」"

msgid "Ami「I'm sure that \"something\" you want to＿talk about is just that shitty little＿Tiger. How dull.」"
msgstr "Ami「Seguro que ese \"algo\" del que quieres＿hablar es sobre esa maldita mocosa＿de Tigre. Qué aburrido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「She hasn't come over since that day.＿She won't even talk to me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No ha venido a casa desde ese día.＿Ni siquiera me dirige la palabra.」"

msgid "Ami「............」"
msgstr "Ami「............」"

msgid "Ami「............」"
msgstr "Ami「............」"

msgid "Ami「......Everyone's so stupid. In the end,＿they know the least about themselves.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Todos son tan tontos.＿Al final, son los que menos＿se conocen a sí mismos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ami「I knew that. I was...... envious of Tiger......」"
msgstr "Ami「Lo sabía. Yo...... le tenía＿envidia a Tigre......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Kawashima......?」"

msgid "Ami「I mean, making food for me and＿cleaning up after me? I wish I had a＿dog like that～①」"
msgstr "Ami「O sea, ¿que me preparen la comida＿y limpien lo mío? Ojalá tuviera＿un perro así～①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Excuse me?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Disculpa?」"

msgid "Ami「Argh, no, no, wet dog smell! This place＿brings back memories～」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Agh, no, no, olor a perro mojado!＿Este lugar me trae recuerdos～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Quit saying I stink!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Deja de decir que apesto!」"

msgid "Ami「Takasu-kun, don't slip up.」"
msgstr "Ami「Takasu-kun, no metas la pata.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......?」"

msgid "Ami「Here's some money for the tea.」"
msgstr "Ami「Aquí tienes dinero para el té.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I said I was treating you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Dije que yo invitaba.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't you treat me like a dog too.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tú tampoco me trates como a un perro.」"

msgid "Ami「Fufu. Off I go～」"
msgstr "Ami「Juju. Me voy～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ami「Whatcha getting so serious for? It's a＿harmless little prank. HILARIOUS,＿though～! It's punishment for ruining」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Por qué te pones tan serio? Es solo＿una bromita inofensiva. ¡GRACIOSÍSIMA,＿eso sí～! Es castigo por arruinar」"

msgid "Ami「Ami-chan's plans. This much is＿nothing.」"
msgstr "Ami「los planes de Ami-chan. Esto no es nada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's just like you said. I spend so much＿time with Taiga, and yet I don't know＿anything. So I want to ask you what」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Como dijiste, paso tanto tiempo con＿Taiga y aun así no sé nada. Por eso＿quiero preguntarte lo que」"

msgid "Ryuuji「you know.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「tú sabes.」"

msgid "Ami「But there will come a time when you＿understand everything, as if all the＿pieces of the puzzle fit perfectly. I」"
msgstr "Ami「Pero llegará un día en que lo entiendas＿todo, como si todas las piezas del＿rompecabezas encajaran. Yo」"

msgid "Ami「think that moment has come for Tiger.」"
msgstr "Ami「creo que ese momento llegó para Tigre.」"

msgid "Ami「But you know, once you finally notice,＿giving up once it's too late, thinking＿too much and making wrong」"
msgstr "Ami「Pero sabes, una vez que por fin te das＿cuenta, rendirte cuando ya es tarde,＿pensar demasiado y tomar malas」"

msgid "Ami「decisions...... it's all so stupid.」"
msgstr "Ami「decisiones...... todo es tan estúpido.」"

msgid "Ami「Hey, just how long are you planning to＿dawdle here? Sure you don't want to＿take that big ol' lunchbox to your」"
msgstr "Ami「Oye, ¿hasta cuándo vas a holgazanear?＿¿No quieres llevarle esa enorme caja de＿almuerzo a tu」"

msgid "Ami「owner?」"
msgstr "Ami「dueña?」"

msgid "Ami「Ami-chan's not so desolate as to let＿someone else's dog treat her. I＿wouldn't want to have to pay you back」"
msgstr "Ami「Ami-chan no está tan desesperada como＿para que el perro de otra la invite. No＿querría tener que pagarte」"

msgid "Ami「double for this.」"
msgstr "Ami「el doble por esto.」"
